{
  "task": "Street Life: passenger seats + Sky Taxi (NPC fares and player taxi requests)",
  "lane": "High-Risk",
  "contract": "See scripts/activities/passengers_taxi/CONTRACT.md. Adds one plain Seat 'PassengerSeat' per built vehicle (VehicleBuildService.addPassengerSeat, nothing else changed); PassengerService owns seating/ejection and the rider mass override (massless while seated, restored on exit; collision groups untouched, VehicleCollisionServer owns them); TaxiJob owns duty, one NPC fare per driver and player taxi requests; all pay via ActivityPayout.Pay (TaxiFare, JobCeiling, unique CommandId, one deferred same-CommandId retry); NPC fares pay only when the server-counted, per-tick-capped driven distance >= MinDrivenFraction x route and elapsed >= route / RaceIntegrity.limitMph; riders are never charged. Flags EnablePassengers / EnableSkyTaxi plus config Enabled.",
